To build one, the following things are needed:
-Lightweight-filament (I did it with ASA Aero)
-Normal PLA/PETG filament
-3d printer capable of printing engineering filaments
- 4 micro-servos (mg90s) + Miuzei MS18
-two DX-LR03 Antennas
-two ESP32 S3 CAM
-Heat brass inserts ( 8x M2; 4x M3; 2x M4 )
-Screws corresponding to the brass inserts + 6x screws for 3d prints
-Spring steel wire (2,5mm x1m; 1,5mm x1m)
